    "P (LeanExe.repeatWhile fuel init cond step) ∧ cond (LeanExe.repeatWhile fuel init cond step) = false",
    "Q (LeanExe.repeatWhile fuel init cond step) from an invariant and a measure below the fuel"
  ],
